@anon.9a3c7070530f84c5ad699604f23a6f35.1869 = private unnamed_addr constant [533 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for `@pytest.mark.usefixtures()` decorators that aren't passed any\0Aarguments.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0AA `@pytest.mark.usefixtures()` decorator that isn't passed any arguments is\0Auseless and should be removed.\0A\0A## Example\0A\0A```python\0Aimport pytest\0A\0A\0A@pytest.mark.usefixtures()\0Adef test_something(): ...\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A\0A```python\0Adef test_something(): ...\0A```\0A\0A## References\0A- [`pytest` documentation: `pytest.mark.usefixtures`](https://docs.pytest.org/en/latest/reference/reference.html#pytest-mark-usefixtures)\0A", align 1
