@anon.9a3c7070530f84c5ad699604f23a6f35.2078 = private unnamed_addr constant [353 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for unnecessary UTF-8 encoding declarations.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0A[PEP 3120] makes UTF-8 the default encoding, so a UTF-8 encoding\0Adeclaration is unnecessary.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0A# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\0Aprint(\22Hello, world!\22)\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Aprint(\22Hello, world!\22)\0A```\0A\0A[PEP 3120]: https://peps.python.org/pep-3120/\0A", align 1
