@anon.9a3c7070530f84c5ad699604f23a6f35.2101 = private unnamed_addr constant [269 x i8] c"## What it does\0AChecks for `else` clauses that only contains `pass` and `...` statements.\0A\0A## Why is this bad?\0ASuch an else clause does nothing and can be removed.\0A\0A## Example\0A```python\0Aif foo:\0A    bar()\0Aelse:\0A    pass\0A```\0A\0AUse instead:\0A```python\0Aif foo:\0A    bar()\0A```\0A", align 1
